        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 138, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2343509097665817343&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Malissa Adkins', rating: 5, text: 'I love coming to the Fridley Dispensary, the staff are so friendly and welcoming. Cash machines on site, a plethora of choices from flower to edibles. So close to my home which has quickly become my favorite stop. By the way you need to try “Grape Cream cake” have your couch and blanket ready! Whole body experience. Thank you 🙏 all of you are so amazing! Until next time… soon I’m sure 😂', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Saundra McCoy', rating: 5, text: 'This is, by far, the best dispensary in Minnesota! The location is simply amazing, and the store’s cozy atmosphere makes me feel right at home. Unlike most other dispensaries I’ve visited in Minnesota, Fridley Dispensary has a unique charm that does not remind me of an Apple store. The staff is incredibly knowledgeable and friendly, and they genuinely care about their customers. Despite the challe', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Patrick Rodriguez', rating: 1, text: 'My partner and I had been looking forward to the opening of this store for several months, especially given its convenient location near our home. We were aware of the initial delays, including the repeatedly resetting countdown clock on the website, and we were understanding and patient, recognizing that unforeseen circumstances can arise.  Once the store opened, however, our experience did not m', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Lisa Adkins', rating: 5, text: 'Fridley Dispensary is conveniently located right off highway 65/Central Avenue. The staff are welcoming and knowledgeable. I highly recommend giving them a try.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Dandy lyonne', rating: 5, text: 'Great quantities for the price! Super friendly staff. Did i mention the price? Its better than all the other dispensaries near by. Finally! A great reason to go to Fridley!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
