        initial: 'LL',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/388/581/avatar/1770743314-ll_hk_wm_logo_.png",
        google: { rating: 4.1, review_count: 57, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11331542417030810410&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kevin Defoe', rating: 5, text: 'Great staff and very knowledgeable on their really good products. Selection has improved. Order online early in the day to make sure you get what you want, seems to sell fast. 1/8THS ARE 4GS HERE (not 3.5g like at other dispos).', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Adam', rating: 4, text: 'Nice little dispensary located in the Hinckley Grand Casino parking lot. Everyone is super nice! Selection is limited. No concentrates available yet. The carts are distillate only and super expensive. No live rosin carts. The flower and pre-rolls are good, but prices are a bit high. I\'m sure as more dispensaries come online, prices will self regulate. All in all it\'s a nice dispensary if you\'re in', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Anthony McGannon (Elune)', rating: 3, text: 'The service was good, but they sold me a broken bowl with my pipe. It was clearly inspected by the cashier and I was in a hurry so I did not doubt them, I got home excited to try it out, only to realize the bowl was broken. I live an hour away so I cannot get it replaced, I\'m quite a bit disappointed.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Forrest St John', rating: 5, text: 'Came in around thanksgiving. Nice little dispensary. Very beautiful & very knowledgeable young lady behind tha glass helping. Fast service. Nothing to complain about!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Brooke Wilsey', rating: 3, text: 'Usually have great service, WAS enjoying the ease of the website. PSA: if you order online, they will change the price when you arrive. I had an order utilizing the valetines discounts, and I decided to combine me and my partners orders, (Flower & cart) when I arrived my total changed and discounts were taken off and I was met with "it\'s out of my hands". Apparently discounts and your points "don\'', time: '3 months ago'}] }
