        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 934, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17509242439144634722&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Gabriel Watkins', rating: 5, text: 'First time there, and it was a great experience. Had to show my ID way more than I\'m used to at a dispensary, but whatever, just do yourself a favor and keep it out. Once in the door, everyone greeting me was very friendly. I was partnered with a "weed guy" named Josh. He was cool, and it made the shopping go quick and smooth, what I want. Josh was easy to talk to and tell him what I wanted. I wor', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jennifer Demery', rating: 5, text: 'Staff was amazing, friendly and very knowledgeable about products. Always greeted with kindness and they have a good sense of humor. Have only purchased pre-rolls but will come back for sure', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Dylan Dean', rating: 5, text: 'Joshua was extremely knowledgeable and exceedingly helpful. He was able to explain all of the items we bought and how they functioned along with helping us find the best deal we could get! 10/10 will buy through him every time!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Nina', rating: 5, text: 'A huge Thank You to Budtender; Kelsey!! She is so knowledgeable!! Because of Kelsey I enjoyed my 1st retail shopping experience. She guided me through making choices, as well as she got me a great price by offering what’s on special. I am an absolutely thrilled Customer!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'deepockets 32', rating: 1, text: 'I really hate to do the 1 star . But this is the 2nd time . 1st I got something like $100 for prerolls . Right off the bat I crack it open smell the tubeand I was like nah nonway.sso I fired that baby up sure enough tasted like mold also smelt all 5 I think I got the all tasted moldy . It may not be mold but it surly had a 3rd flavor I am not looking for .  All the pre rolls  I got all different a', time: '3 months ago'}] }
